PATH NOTE (generator drift — declared, not silent · Covenant #9)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The prompt's manifest declares the output under `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Admin/**`.
That directory does NOT exist and is NOT compiled by any target. The REAL home of
every P7 admin page in this repo is `apps/apple/Sources/Features/Admin/` (20+ siblings:
SlowQueriesPage, TeslaOrdersPage, RbacMatrixPage, …), which the `TeslaSync` /
`TeslaSync-macOS` app targets compile via `project.yml`'s `- path: Sources`. The page
was therefore placed with its siblings so it actually builds and integrates. The
companion P4 component the web page embeds (`UserImpersonateButton`) already lives at
`apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/UserImpersonateButton.*` and is reused verbatim.

